You may not require the recipients to pay a fee for the exercise of rights
granted or affirmed under this License.

5. Conveying Modified Source Versions.

You may convey a work based on the Program, or the modifications to
it in the form of source code, provided that you also meet all of these
conditions: (a) The work must carry prominent notices stating that you
modified it, and giving a relevant date. (b) The work must carry
